---

<Layout>
  <Gnb />

  <PageBanner
    title="e-Commerce"
    subtitle={[
      'Commerce Platform에 속도와 생산성을 높이다.',
      '"Front –BackOffice-Interface" 모듈화 된 e-Commerce 아키텍처! AI와 융합 및 빠른 구축과 확장성을 제공합니다.'
    ]}
  />

  <Title
    variant="hero"
    title="Commerce Technology"
    subtitle={[
      '"일반 커머스를 비롯 ~ 실시간 시세, 환율, 재고 연동형 거래 및 기업간의 자재, 원자재 거래를 플랫폼으로 구현한 B2B 특화된 커머스 기술력을 보유하고 있습니다."',
      '「Front ↔ BackOffice ↔ Interface」 상호 간의 최적화 된 e-Commerce 프레임워크 기반 커머스 시스템 제공'
    ]}
  />

  <Container maxWidth={1760} class="company-page-end">
    <Tab variant="box" items={sectionTabs} activeIndex={0} />

    <section id="features" class="ec-section">
      <Title variant="section" prefix="제공 " highlight="기술 및 특징" />

      <div class="ec__feature-grid">
        {
          featureCards.map((card) => (
            <div class="ai-ml__feature-card">
              <div class="ai-ml__feature-head">
                <IconCircle icon={card.icon} />
                <p class="ai-ml__feature-title">{card.title}</p>
              </div>
              <div class="ai-ml__feature-list">
                {card.items.map((text) => (
                  <TextList>{text}</TextList>
                ))}
              </div>
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="usage" class="ec-section">
      <Title variant="section" prefix="활용 " highlight="분야" />

      <div class="ec__tag-row">
        {mallTypes.map((type) => <span class="ec__tag">{type}</span>)}
      </div>

      <Title variant="banner" title="e-Commerce 프레임워크" class="ec__banner" />

      <div class="ec__tag-row ec__block">
        {coreFunctions.map((fn) => <span class="ec__tag">{fn}</span>)}
      </div>

      <div class="ec__layer">
        <p class="ec__layer-label">프론트 (사용자)</p>
        <div class="ec__cat-grid">
          {
            coreFunctions.map((fn, i) => (
              <div class="ec__cat-group">
                <p class="ec__cat-title">{fn}</p>
                <div class="ec__cat-items">
                  {frontFeatures[i].map((item) => (
                    <p class="ec__cat-item">{item}</p>
                  ))}
                </div>
              </div>
            ))
          }
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ec__layer">
        <p class="ec__layer-label">백오피스 (관리자)</p>
        <div class="ec__cat-grid">
          {
            coreFunctions.map((fn, i) => (
              <div class="ec__cat-group">
                <p class="ec__cat-title">{fn}</p>
                <div class="ec__cat-items">
                  {backofficeFeatures[i].map((item) => (
                    <p class="ec__cat-item">{item}</p>
                  ))}
                </div>
              </div>
            ))
          }
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ec__layer">
        <p class="ec__layer-label">Interface</p>
        <div class="ec__cat-grid">
          {
            interfaceGroups.map((group) => (
              <div class="ec__cat-group">
                <p class="ec__cat-title">{group.label}</p>
                <p class="ec__cat-item">{group.value}</p>
              </div>
            ))
          }
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="clients" class="ec-section">
      <Title
        variant="section"
        prefix="주요 "
        highlight="고객사"
        subtitle={[
          '다양한 커머스 플랫폼 프로젝트를 성공적으로 수행하며 실행력을 입증했으며, 신뢰할 수 있는 상생 파트너로 자리매김을 했습니다.'
        ]}
      />
      <div class="ai-commerce__client-grid">
        {
          clientKeys.map((key) => (
            <div class="ai-commerce__client-card">
              <img src={logoSrc(key)} alt="주요 고객사 로고" loading="lazy" />
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="references" class="ec-section">
      <Title variant="section" prefix="주요 " highlight="레퍼런스" />
      <div class="ec__box-grid">
        {
          references.map((item) => (
            <div class="ec__ref-card">
              <div class="ec__ref-head">
                <div class="ec__ref-title-row">
                  <p class="ec__ref-title">{item.title}</p>
                </div>
                <p class="ec__ref-desc">{item.desc}</p>
              </div>
              <div class="ec__ref-list">
                {item.list.map((text) => (
                  <TextList>{text}</TextList>
                ))}
              </div>
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </section>
  </Container>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
